This foundation build uses development-time tooling only. It contains zero third-party runtime code or runtime dependencies.

Development Tooling:
- fast-check (version 4.10.2, MIT): Property-based testing framework used for property tests verifying display rounding, countdown bounds, and temporal invariants.
- astronomy-engine (version 2.1.19, MIT): Astronomical calculation engine evaluated during engine selection benchmark (selected winner).
- suncalc (version 2.1.4, BSD-2-Clause): Astronomical calculation library evaluated during engine selection benchmark.

A comprehensive inventory of third-party assets, licences, and font attributions will be generated during final release hardening in Prompt 12.
